{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows异常发现信号伴随异常进程映像。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：Unusual Discovery Signal Alert with Unusual Process Executable。","from":"now-9m","index":[".alerts-security.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows异常发现信号伴随异常进程映像","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"72ed9140-fe9d-4a34-a026-75b50e484b17","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"host.os.type:windows and event.kind:signal and kibana.alert.rule.rule_id:\"1d72d014-e2ab-4707-b056-9b96abe7b511\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows异常发现信号伴随异常进程映像\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清域、账号、网络或主机\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["host.id","user.id","process.executable"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":5,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"related_integrations":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
